Create the file /Users/chiu.fyi/work/find-nepal-trek-website/src/data/treks.ts

This file should export an array of Trek objects with comprehensive, realistic data for 6 Nepal treks. Use the Trek type defined below:

```typescript
export type DifficultyLevel = "easy" | "moderate" | "challenging" | "strenuous";

export interface TrekItineraryDay {
  day: number;
  titleEn: string;
  titleZh: string;
  descriptionEn: string;
  descriptionZh: string;
  altitude?: number;
  walkingHours?: number;
}

export interface Trek {
  slug: string;
  nameEn: string;
  nameZh: string;
  descriptionEn: string;
  descriptionZh: string;
  difficulty: DifficultyLevel;
  durationDays: number;
  maxAltitude: number;
  priceUSD: number;
  bestSeasons: string[];
  bestSeasonsZh: string[];
  heroImage: string;
  images: string[];
  featured: boolean;
  itinerary: TrekItineraryDay[];
  includedEn: string[];
  includedZh: string[];
  highlightsEn: string[];
  highlightsZh: string[];
}
```

Import the Trek type from "@/types/trek".

The 6 treks are:

1. **Everest Base Camp** (slug: "everest-base-camp")
   - Difficulty: challenging, 14 days, max 5364m, $1800
   - Featured: true
   - Best seasons: Mar-May, Sep-Nov
   - Full day-by-day itinerary from Kathmandu to Lukla to EBC and back
   - Include 2-3 paragraph English and Chinese descriptions
   - Highlights: Sagarmatha National Park, Sherpa culture, Tengboche Monastery, Khumbu Glacier, Kala Patthar sunrise, etc.
   - Included: airport transfers, domestic flights, accommodation, meals, guide, permits, etc.

2. **Annapurna Circuit** (slug: "annapurna-circuit")
   - Difficulty: challenging, 18 days, max 5416m (Thorong La Pass), $1600
   - Featured: true
   - Best seasons: Mar-May, Oct-Nov
   - Full itinerary through diverse terrain zones

3. **Langtang Valley** (slug: "langtang-valley")
   - Difficulty: moderate, 10 days, max 3870m, $900
   - Featured: true
   - Best seasons: Mar-May, Sep-Nov
   - Great alternative to crowded Everest/Annapurna

4. **Manaslu Circuit** (slug: "manaslu-circuit")
   - Difficulty: strenuous, 16 days, max 5106m (Larkya La Pass), $2200
   - Featured: false
   - Remote and less-touristed

5. **Poon Hill** (slug: "poon-hill")
   - Difficulty: easy, 5 days, max 3210m, $500
   - Featured: false
   - Perfect beginner trek, famous sunrise viewpoint

6. **Upper Mustang** (slug: "upper-mustang")
   - Difficulty: moderate, 14 days, max 3840m, $2500
   - Featured: false
